{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34715","headline":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平声 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美苦雨四声重寄三十二句 平声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽栖眠疎窗，豪居凭高楼。\n浮沤惊跳丸，寒声思重裘。\n牀前垂文竿，巢边登轻舟。\n虽无东臯田，还生鱼乎忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}